.github.com/users/dusunax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dusunax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dusunax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dusunax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dusunax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dusunax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dusunax/module-federation/commits/a0375f0cc0e7c425f990f92b5b645191faa55752/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-31T17:38:45Z","email":"94776135+dusunax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dusuna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-31T17:38:45Z","email":"94776135+dusunax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dusuna"},"message":"refactor: 1) processing, orders DB 연결 2) Cart 저장 방식 쿠키로 변경 3) 미사용 인터페이스 키 관련 코드 정리\n\n- Added `orderService.js` to handle user orders in Firestore.\n- Introduced `rememberingStore.js` for managing remembering items using Zustand.\n- Updated `webpack.config.js` in `auth` and `cart` to expose new services and stores.\n- Refactored `Cart.js` to utilize `rememberingStore` for managing remembering items.\n- Enhanced `useCartItems` to calculate remembering items based on Firestore data.\n- Modified `RememberingSection` and `RememberingItemCard` components to display Firestore data.\n- Implemented `useRememberProgress` to track progress of remembering items and create orders.\n- Added `useRememberingSync` to synchronize remembering items with user authentication state.\n- Updated `ProductDetail` and `ProductList` to reflect remembering item statuses.\n- Established a connection between user orders and remembering items in `bootstrap.js`.","tree":{"sha":"a693666f4489ad5bc00e40ba648029db5edc65af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dusunax/module-federation/git/trees/a693666f4489ad5bc00e40ba648029db5edc65af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dusunax/module-federation/git/commit