ts/a5eaff1dcfc176a5d4d75fdd95e8d2e2a11d8f6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-24T21:27:18Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Copilot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-24T21:27:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add ScreenCapture component, imaging-report and orthanc-viewer microfrontends (#13)\n\n* Initial plan\n\n* Add ScreenCapture component with tests and documentation\n\nCo-authored-by: dermatologist <6259644+dermatologist@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add example usage file for ScreenCapture component\n\nCo-authored-by: dermatologist <6259644+dermatologist@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix linter errors in example file\n\nCo-authored-by: dermatologist <6259644+dermatologist@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add imaging-report microfrontend using ScreenCapture component\n\nCo-authored-by: dermatologist <6259644+dermatologist@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add mock implementation for ResizeObserver in test setup\n\n* Add esm-dhti-imaging-report package to README\n\n* Add Orthanc DICOM server integration with viewer and uploader\n\nCo-authored-by: dermatologist <6259644+dermatologist@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Update documentation for Orthanc DICOM integration\n\nCo-authored-by: dermatologist <6259644+dermatologist@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix slot name for imaging report widget in routes configuration\n\n* Enhance tests for ImagingReportWidget and useOrthanc hook with improved async handling\n\n* Refactor ImagingReportWidget for improved error handling and code clarity\n\n* Refactor OrthancViewer and useOrthanc hook for improved code clarity and functionality\n\n* Refactor imports in imaging report components for consistency and clarity\n\n* Refactor OrthancViewer and useOrthanc hook for improved image handling and response parsing\n\n* Refactor useOrthanc hook to improve error handling and response parsing\n\n* Update Orthanc URL in README and components for consiste