nd card generation\n\n* fix: Correct return statement in process_file method to ensure successful file processing message\n\n* feat: Refactor bootstrap to include inline index schema and remove redis_schema.yaml\n\n* feat: Update dependencies and modify bootstrap for Redis connection and embedding model\n\n* feat: Update Google LLM and embedding model in bootstrap for improved performance\n\n* feat: Refactor server files to update port and remove redis_schema.yaml in favor of inline index schema\n\n* feat: Add CDS hook discovery configuration and update input handling in DhtiChain\n\n* feat: Update dhti-elixir-base dependency to version 1.4.1 across multiple packages\n\n* feat: Add DHTI Elixir Generator skill with documentation and example requests\n\n* feat: Update test cases to use ''input'' instead of ''file'' for ChainInput and process_file method\n\n* Update packages/upload_file/src/dhti_elixir_upload/chain.py\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbb9e1f96856c42d41ceb4ec66cce7c7ab0373f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dermatologist/dhti-elixir/git/trees/dbb9e1f96856c42d41ceb4ec66cce7c7ab0373f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dermatologist/dhti-elixir/git/commits/6899a65e01a73de3187e0f5f93cbd5b896f2180a","verification":{"payload":"tree dbb9e1f96856c42d41ceb4ec66cce7c7ab0373f9\nparent 10a92bd05c9104204424102e1877dcf15d9a38bd\nauthor Bell Eapen <github_public@gulfdoctor.net> 1768822727 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1768822727 -0600\n\nFeature/simple rag (#8)\n\n* Add initial implementation of file upload functionality and related utilities\n\n* Refactor bootstrap function and remove unused chain module\n\n* Add file upload processing and testing utilities\n\n* Implement file upload functionality with bootstrap and server integration; add tests for upload chain and processing request\n\n* Enhance file uplo