os los ancestros\n- Cascade delete: eliminar padre elimina descendientes + recalc ancestros\n- DeleteConfirmToast: snackbar MERIDIAN con conteo de subcuentas y filas resaltadas en rojo\n- Grid: table-layout fixed + colgroup + sin virtualización (250 filas nativas = sin temblor ni secciones negras)\n- PresupuestoDetalleRow: custom areEqual memo + estilos estáticos extraídos + td nativo\n- Resumen: totales alineados al fondo + indicador ⚠ en cuentas con discrepancia + scroll habilitado + ancho completo\n- MontoInput: discrepancia en warning.main (amarillo) en vez de error.main (rojo)\n- presupuestoTree.ts: funciones puras de árbol (buildTreeMaps, recalcAncestors, removeWithDescendants)","tree":{"sha":"095c9a9a2a9b0feab697819105e0ad132882a4dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/git/trees/095c9a9a2a9b0feab697819105e0ad132882a4dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/git/commits/bca24d4c8008310c057d88a4f3931483b717e41e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17985284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos2280","id":17985284,"login":"carlos2280","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTg1Mjg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"http