id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos2280","id":17985284,"login":"carlos2280","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTg1Mjg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/commits/2acae48250c97cd865060151d647665b24becc35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T18:58:18Z","email":"cfuentesfuentes@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Roberto Fuentes Fuentes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T18:58:18Z","email":"cfuentesfuentes@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Roberto Fuentes Fuentes"},"message":"feat(fase-2): estabilidad y calidad — logging, shutdown, health checks, índices DB\n\n## 2.1 Logging unificado con Pino\n- Agrega @municipal/shared/logger: factory createLogger(service) y requestIdMiddleware\n- Migra todos los microservicios de console.log a Pino estructurado\n- Agrega pino + pino-pretty como dependencias de @municipal/shared\n- Elimina console.log de debug del frontend (mf_store, mf_contabilidad, mf_chat)\n\n## 2.2 Graceful Shutdown\n- Implementa handlers SIGTERM/SIGINT en api-identidad, api-autorizacion,\n  api-contabilidad, api-platform, api-gateway\n- api-chat: agrega SIGINT (ya tenía SIGTERM); normaliza con timeout forzado de 10s\n\n## 2.3 Health Checks Reales\n- Reemplaza health checks estáticos por verificación real con SELECT 1\n- api-chat verifica Redis con ping(); retorna HTTP 503 si falla\n\n## 2.4 Índices faltantes en DB (13 índices)\n- mensajería: idx_mensajes_*, idx_participantes_*, idx_llamadas_conv, idx_archivos_mensaje\n- contabilidad: idx_planes_parent, idx_presup_det_cuenta, idx_presup_det_centro\n- identidad: idx_usuarios_oficina, idx_oficinas_depto, idx_deptos_direccion\n\n## 2.6 Error Responses Consistentes\n- Agrega @municipal/shared/errors: ApiErrorResponse, ApiSuccessResponse, AppError, createErrorResponse\n- Todos los errorHandler retornan { success, code, message, requestId, timestamp }\n\n## 2.7 Timestamps con Timezone\n- Migra todas las columnas timestamp() a timestamp({ withTimezone: true })\n  en schemas identidad, contabilidad, mensajería y platform\n- PENDIENTE: ejecutar `pnpm generate && pnpm migrate` en packages/shared\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22a6b444f9f553011ecaecf6234815df9570dc60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/git/trees/22a6b444f9f553011ecaecf6234815df9570dc60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/git/commits/2acae48250c97cd865060151d647665b24becc35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17985284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos2280","id":17985284,"login":"carlos2280","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTg1Mjg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280","