ault-src ''none'', HSTS producción-only, Referrer-Policy no-referrer\n- Rate limiting: login 5/15min por IP, usuarios autenticados 200/min por userId\n- Zod validate middleware + schemas en los 5 servicios (endpoints POST/PATCH/PUT)\n- localStorage eliminado de authSlice y authApi — consolidado en Redux Persist (sessionStorage)\n- fix: typar centroCosto de leftJoin en presupuestos.service (error 18047)","tree":{"sha":"c30588e4d29d303e5ba800de15eb3f63920ee3a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/git/trees/c30588e4d29d303e5ba800de15eb3f63920ee3a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/git/commits/a1afa270b1c090dd1995684de3c56055b98ac32a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17985284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos2280","id":17985284,"login":"carlos2280","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTg1Mjg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/commit/a1afa270b1c090dd1995684de3c56055b98ac32a","node_id":"C_kwDOQ4As2doAKGExYWZhMjcwYjFjMDkwZGQxOTk1Njg0ZGUzYzU2MDU1Yjk4YWMzMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://