o): módulo completo de presupuesto inicial con import Excel, grid virtualizado y seeders\n\n- Backend: schemas Drizzle (presupuestos, detalle, centros de costo), controllers, services y rutas REST\n- Frontend: componentes Atomic Design (atoms, molecules, organisms), hooks SOLID, tipos y validación Zod\n- Import Excel: parseo de hojas Ingresos/Gastos con códigos clasificadores variables, toasts progresivos y startTransition\n- Grid virtualizado con @tanstack/react-virtual para rendimiento con ~250+ filas\n- Tabs con display:none para cambio instantáneo entre Ingresos y Gastos\n- RTK Query API (presupuestosApi) con CRUD completo\n- Seeders: plan de cuentas presupuestarias 2026 y centros de costo desde Excel municipal real","tree":{"sha":"c2332164b1fc66c4728783ba850e2e0ad6e7f88f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/git/trees/c2332164b1fc66c4728783ba850e2e0ad6e7f88f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/git/commits/2ceee9c8a11c8398c05d67ff4a7ac7b694248f20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17985284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos2280","id":17985284,"login":"carlos2280","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTg1Mjg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/sub