nes con onIniciar/onJoin conectados\n- Backend: participantesIds opcionales al crear reunión, invitaciones enriquecidas con nombreUsuario\n- Llamadas de reunión: \"salir\" no finaliza la llamada (permite rejoin); solo se finaliza al cancelar\n- Rejoin: reactivación automática de llamada finalizada si la reunión sigue activa (400 → 200)\n- MessageList: scroll doble (inmediato + 250ms diferido) para capturar contenido async de MeetingCard\n- Socket: invalidación de cache RTK Query en todos los eventos meeting:* para sincronizar dispositivos","tree":{"sha":"67b9136e1afb70e585d96d021b0ab92e13419b4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/git/trees/67b9136e1afb70e585d96d021b0ab92e13419b4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/git/commits/672dc4dcefb993f88b414b0810ea1434a01a97ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17985284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos2280","id":17985284,"login":"carlos2280","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTg1Mjg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/commit/672dc4dcefb993f88