Roberto Fuentes Fuentes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-16T01:45:47Z","email":"cfuentesfuentes@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Roberto Fuentes Fuentes"},"message":"fix(mf): agregar assetPrefix auto para resolver chunks cross-origin\n\nSin assetPrefix, los chunks de los MFs remotos usan rutas root-relative\n(/static/js/xxx.js) que se resuelven contra el dominio del host (mf-shell)\nen vez del dominio del remote (mf-store, mf-ui, etc).\n\nassetPrefix: ''auto'' hace que webpack determine el publicPath en runtime\nbasándose en la URL del script, resolviendo correctamente cross-origin.","tree":{"sha":"48c746d19a18ab35e526d2b8424e211eb8be7406","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/git/trees/48c746d19a18ab35e526d2b8424e211eb8be7406"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlos2280/sistema-municipal/git/commits/612e2bf47da2596ee99c12a5498e3f07ed323c7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17985284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos2280","id":17985284,"login":"carlos2280","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTg1Mjg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos2280","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com