"date":"2026-01-14T03:23:42Z","email":"malcohelper@gmail.com","name":"malcohelper"},"message":"Refactors authentication to use Keychain\n\nMigrates authentication logic to a native module for improved security using Keychain.\n\nThis change replaces the existing AsyncStorage-based authentication with a more secure Keychain-based solution. This includes:\n- Moving authentication and token management to a native module.\n- Implementing secure token storage using Keychain.\n- Updating the AuthContext to use the new native module and Keychain for authentication.\n- Removing the authApi.ts and TokenRefreshService.ts, SecureStorage.ts.\n- Adding Firebase dependencies for chat functionality.","tree":{"sha":"4b25f362c9e21200102e43341053d79353a7146e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/malcohelper/super-app-demo/git/trees/4b25f362c9e21200102e43341053d79353a7146e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/malcohelper/super-app-demo/git/commits/a0eb5336d1dc31492541c4a382d774dd1850e998","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151494484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malcohelper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malcohelper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malcohelper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malcohelper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/malcohelper","id":151494484,"login":"malcohelper","node_id":"U_kgDOCQefVA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malcohelper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malcohelper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malcohelper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malcohelper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malcohelper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"ht