475cf36a80f9fae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7460895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ujjawal-Anand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ujjawal-Anand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ujjawal-Anand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ujjawal-Anand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ujjawal-Anand","id":7460895,"login":"Ujjawal-Anand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NjA4OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ujjawal-Anand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ujjawal-Anand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ujjawal-Anand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ujjawal-Anand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ujjawal-Anand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ujjawal-Anand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ujjawal-Anand/tga-case-study/commits/a355de24945eb41c2346ae9e9934cfbb8ef03a82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T05:42:03Z","email":"ujjawalanand1729@gmail.com","name":"ujjawal-anand"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T05:42:03Z","email":"ujjawalanand1729@gmail.com","name":"ujjawal-anand"},"message":"feat: complete user authentication system with proto field naming fixes\n\nImplemented and debugged full user authentication flow with JWT tokens,\nresolving critical proto field naming issues and GraphQL serialization errors.\n\n## Features Implemented\n- User registration with JWT access/refresh tokens\n- User login with token validation\n- Protected GraphQL queries (me, validateSession)\n- Authentication middleware with context building\n- Frontend user-auth microfrontend integration\n\n## Critical Bug Fixes\n\n### Proto Field Naming (snake_case vs camelCase)\n- Fixed auth middleware: validation.userId → validation.user_id\n- Fixed user resolver: userId → user_id in all gRPC calls\n- Fixed UserServiceImpl: call.request.userId → call.request.user_id\n- Standardized all proto fields to snake_case with keepCase: true\n\n### User Entity Enhancements\n- Added missing password getter method\n- Added recordFailedLogin() method\n- Added recordSuccessfulLogin() method\n\n### Use Case Fixes\n- LoginUseCase: Added preferences and updatedAt fields to DTO\n- GetProfileUseCase: Changed UserId.create() → UserId.fromString()\n- ValidateTokenUseCase: Fixed user_id field mapping\n\n### GraphQL Resolver Improvements\n- Added parseGender() function for GENDER_UNSPECIFIED enum handling\n- Enhanced convertTimestamp() with proper date validation\n- Added null checks for optional fields (gender, dateOfBirth, bio)\n- Improved transformPreferences() with default values\n\n## Files Modified\n- User Service: User.ts, LoginUseCase.ts, GetProfileUseCase.ts, ValidateTokenUseCase.ts, UserServiceImpl.ts\n- GraphQL Gateway: auth.ts, user.resolver.ts, user.graphql, index-grpc.ts\n- Frontend: LoginPage.tsx, RegisterPage.tsx, useAuth.ts\n- Proto: Consolidated to user-service.proto, removed duplicates\n\n## Verification\n- Registration mutation tested and working\n- Login mutation tested and working\n- Token validation verified via gRPC\n- Protected queries (me, validateSession) working\n- Test users created: test@example.com, finaltest@example.com\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a309e0ce6af48c769192f7362af10f786cef0a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ujjawal-Anand/tga-case-study/git/trees/3a309e0ce6af48c769192f7362af10f786cef0a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ujjawal-Anand/tga-case-study/git/commits/a355de24945eb41c2346ae9e9934cfbb8ef03a82","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://a