ttps://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/f8e02edefc547de6a63b2cd982800ec988eedf47"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm","id":77401788,"login":"Okan-wqm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDAxNzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/57076d8a357afbbd5de85e96f24860fd726be41e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:43:14Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:43:14Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"message":"refactor(farm): relax the parameter-source columns in the entity before the expand migration\n\nRelease A of the water-chemistry binding owner (plan rev2 D9). The expand\nmigration that follows drops NOT NULL on water_quality_param_equipment''s\nequipmentId (a source can sit at a site, system or tank point instead),\nmonitoringFrequency and alertEnabled (null on a channel source, D14).\n\nThe schema-drift validator routes \"entity NOT NULL, DB column nullable\" as\nnullability drift, an error class that fails a production-like boot. Run\nunder the release still serving, the migration would leave every restarted\npod unable to boot. The reverse direction is not drift, so the entity and\nthe GraphQL type relax first, with no DDL; the migration ships after this\nis deployed. The validator''s lack of expand-awareness is raised to the\narbiter as DATA-MEDIUM-020.\n\nMints FARM-HIGH-373, FARM-MEDIUM-374, FARM-MEDIUM-375 and DATA-MEDIUM-020\nwith the review note; this commit closes none of them.\n\nENTITY-DIFF-OK: farm-service — nullability relaxation only; the DDL is the\nnext commit''s migration and must deploy after this one.","tree":{"sha":"246d2851209295992eb2f31aa169c494be728d8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/trees/246d2851209295992eb2f31aa169c494be728d8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/commits/57076d8a357afbbd5de85e96f24860fd726be41e","verification":{"payload":"tree 246d2851209295992eb2f31aa169c494be728d8d\nparent 76279e0314ea63e54630db3af67d6b0366a8a794\nauthor OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791459794 +0200\ncommitter OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791459794 +0200\n\nrefactor(farm): relax the parameter-source columns in the entity before the expand migration\n\nRelease A of the water-chemistry binding owner (plan rev2 D9). The expand\nmigration that follows drops NOT NULL on water_quality_param_equipment''s\nequipmentId (a source can sit at a site, system or tank point instead),\nmonitoringFrequency and alertEnabled (null on a channel source, D14).\n\nThe schema-drift validator routes \"entity NOT NULL, DB column nullable\" as\nnullability drift, an error class that fails a production-like boot. Run\nunder the release still serving, the migration would leave every restarted\npod unable to boot. The reverse direction is not drift, so the entity and\nthe GraphQL type relax first, with no DDL; the migration ships after this\nis deployed. The validator''s lack of expa