s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/03e75a03cbb09ac67dcd09876052c0878ff188ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:00:29Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:00:29Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"message":"Merge origin/main into fix/sensor-edge-mqtt-auth-rls\n\nConflicts in edge-device.service.ts and provisioning.service.ts kept both\nsides. main moved the stale-offline sweep into runInTenantTransaction per\nactive tenant (SENSOR-MEDIUM-136) and made SENSOR_SOURCE_SCHEMA the one name\nfor the sensor source schema at every tenant boundary (SENSOR-LOW-147); this\nbranch restricted that sweep to the mayHoldBrokerSession states. The merged\nsweep is main''s per-tenant boundary with this branch''s allow-list.\n\nFollowing main''s invariants, this branch''s new boundary calls (device and key\ndirectories, provisioning, heartbeat, route purge) take SENSOR_SOURCE_SCHEMA,\nand its three real-Postgres specs boot through the shared\nsensor-rls-postgres harness (SENSOR-HIGH-148). The harness gains cross-tenant\n`sensor` tables (created, FORCE RLS armed, DML granted) and grants DELETE on\ntenant tables, matching tenant-schema-privileges. main''s scheduled-jobs RLS\nspec passes the directory collaborator EdgeDeviceService now takes.","tree":{"sha":"ed011f51113588f766afe3ea82ae35263560fc55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/trees/ed011f51113588f766afe3ea82ae35263560fc55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/commits/03e75a03cbb09ac67dcd09876052c0878ff188ae","verification":{"payload":"tree ed011f51113588f766afe3ea82ae35263560fc55\nparent c2f09cea395007fe7ae74dd221692bcd97a7a800\nparent bc585ff33ccf335cb679d22fa8d559d9e12672d5\nauthor OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791453629 +0200\ncommitter OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791453629 +0200\n\nMerge origin/main into fix/sensor-edge-mqtt-auth-rls\n\nConflicts in edge-device.service.ts and provisioning.service.ts kept both\nsides. main moved the stale-offline sweep into runInTenantTransaction per\nactive tenant (SENSOR-MEDIUM-136) and made SENSOR_SOURCE_SCHEMA the one name\nfor the sensor source schema at every tenant boundary (SENSOR-LOW-147); this\nbranch restricted that sweep to the mayHoldBrokerSession states. The merged\nsweep is main''s per-tenant boundary with this branch''s allow-list.\n\nFollowing main''s invariants, this branch''s new boundary calls (device and key\ndirectories, provisioning, heartbeat, route purge) take SENSOR_SOURCE_SCHEMA,\nand its three real-Postgres specs boot through the shared\nsensor-rls-postgres harness (SENSOR-HIGH-148). The harness gains cross-tenant\n`sensor` tables (created, FORCE RLS armed, DML granted) and grants DELETE on\ntenant tables, matching tenant-schema-privileges. main''s scheduled-jobs RLS\nspec passes the directory collaborator EdgeDeviceService now takes.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS9nW+eHMNSWNfFYQCzIGjH0vPV\nFOzX4vIkcOMgrtmEIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGhHwXRUNDl9hWtpTvwaPCoxTOEUl0C9JPOeN+0EE3nsexne7pdYqtXhRgctTaG/44\nhPqpTsXa4FOWmoqbb4/Aw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T10:11:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercont