ply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:07:28Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"message":"chore(reviews): track the three unit readers the measurement-unit change leaves open\n\nThe farm review of the unit reader fix left three surfaces that cannot\nmove inside this change: the AI query replies need a contract field, the\nhistory table needs a unit name the list type does not expose yet (PR-5),\nand system readers need PR-4''s topology rule. Each gets an owner and a\ndeadline instead of a note.","tree":{"sha":"6a7f4b40b853f85438635765f79c1d5d82617b98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/trees/6a7f4b40b853f85438635765f79c1d5d82617b98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/commits/aa6a0fd1524c551d54eb1128dd1b23fbcbd853e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 6a7f4b40b853f85438635765f79c1d5d82617b98\nparent b80f7a7874a78e82d47301fec3e8713e5cc72e78\nauthor OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791446848 +0200\ncommitter OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791446848 +0200\n\nchore(reviews): track the three unit readers the measurement-unit change leaves open\n\nThe farm review of the unit reader fix left three surfaces that cannot\nmove inside this change: the AI query replies need a contract field, the\nhistory table needs a unit name the list type does not expose yet (PR-5),\nand system readers need PR-4''s topology rule. Each gets an owner and a\ndeadline instead of a note.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS9nW+eHMNSWNfFYQCzIGjH0vPV\nFOzX4vIkcOMgrtmEIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHTBfJpGOjtJTBMGwNYubtxkeTJSR7exw6s9aBom+5000FlCJfyHYsair4FPYmBtuQ\nJDDwk0RX0uMwV1YsIXRQc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T08:49:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm","id":77401788,"login":"Okan-wqm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDAxNzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commit/aa6a0fd1524c551d54eb1128dd1b23fbcbd853e5","node_id":"C_kwDOQ4Ocb9oAKGFhNmEwZmQxNTI0YzU1MWQ1NGViMTEyOGRkMWIyM2ZiY2JkODUzZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commit/b80f7a7874a78e82d47301fec3e8713e5cc72e78","sha":"b80f7a7874a78e82d47301fec3e8713e5cc72e78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/b80f7a7874a78e82d47301fec3e8713e5cc72e78"}],"sha":"aa6a0fd1524c551d54eb1128dd1b23fbcbd853e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/aa6a0fd1524c551d54eb1128dd1b23fbcbd853e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm","id":77401788,"login":"Okan-wqm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDAxNzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/b80f7a7874a78e82d47301fec3e8713e5cc72e78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:04:25Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:04:25Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"message":"fix(farm): a unit''s water-quality form and the server share one plan, and a measurement is filed by its unit''s kind\n\nEvery client sends the picked unit as equipmentId, and farm''s unit list mixes tanks with water equipment. The validator refused every value for a unit nobody mapped (an empty plan; prod had no mappings), the forms and the validator applied different rules, writers filed the unit in both columns or only as equipment, and the site check read only tankId, denying equipment-only submissions to a MODULE_USER. One classifier (measurement-unit.ts) files a unit as tankId or equipmentId and resolves its site; all three writers use it, and the unit''s site is the only one stored. One plan (measurement-plan.ts) is read by the validator and the new unitMeasurementPlan query the farm-module and AquaMobil forms use. The batch input gets the same human-source gate as the single create. Not in this change: the binding owner and its expand migration (PR-3.1/3.2).\n\nFiling a unit by kind leaves a non-tank unit''s row with tankId NULL, so every reader now names a measurement''s unit through one owner, measurement-unit-reader.ts (COALESCE(tankId, equipmentId), and an index-friendly match): the critical list (whose old join compared unquoted latest.tankId and failed on Postgres), the list (new unitId filter; tankId and systemId match by unit), latest, chart, statistics, the system readers, the manual-temperature reads, traceability, update() validation and RecordTab''s recent entries. An invariant spec fails on a farm reader keyed on tankId alone. The plan ignores mappings to soft-deleted or foreign configs, and AquaMobil invalidates the plan by one shared key.\n\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-08-wq-measurement-unit.md#FARM-HIGH-367\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-08-wq-measurement-unit.md#FARM-MEDIUM-368","tree":{"sha":"0ed17feae399fcb6999810b44ae2f5d00d92e625","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/trees/0ed17feae399fcb6999810b44ae2f5d00d92e625"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/commits/b80f7a7874a78e82d47301fec3e8713e5cc72e78","verification":{"payload":"tree 0ed17feae399fcb6999810b44ae2f5d00d92e625\nparent 513fe7d4f5e46fccd1963fd062971a86a1d9d343\nauthor OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791446665 +0200\ncommitter OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791446665 +0200\n\nfix(farm): a unit''s water-quality form and the server share one plan, and a measurement is filed by its unit''s kind\n\nEvery client sends the picked unit as equipmentId, and farm''s unit list mixes tanks with water equipment. The validator refused every value for a unit nobody mapped (an empty plan; prod had no mappings), the forms and the validator applied different rules, writers filed the unit in both columns or only as equipment, and the site check read only tankId, denying equipment-only submissions to a MODULE_USER. One classifier (measurement-unit.ts) files a unit as tankId or equipmentId and resolves its site; all three writers use it, and the unit''s site is the only one stored. One plan (measurement-plan.ts) is read by the validator and the new unitMeasurementPlan query the farm-module and AquaMobil forms use. The batch input gets the same human-source gate as the single create. Not in this change: the binding owner and its expand migration (PR-3.1/3.2).\n\nFiling a unit by kind leaves a non-tank unit''s row with tankId NULL, so every reader now names a measurement''s unit through one owner, measurement-unit-reader.ts (COALESCE(tankId, equipmentId), and an index-friendly match): the critical list (whose old join compared unquoted latest.tankId and failed on Postgres), the list (new unitId filter; tankId and systemId match by unit), latest, chart, statistics, the system readers, the manual-temperature reads, traceability, update() validation and RecordTab''s recent entries. An invariant spec fails on a farm reader keyed on tankId alone. The plan ignores mappings to soft-deleted or foreign configs, and AquaMobil invalidates the plan by one shared key.\n\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-08-wq-measurement-unit.md#FARM-HIGH-367\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-08-wq-measurement-unit.md#FARM-MEDIUM-368\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS9nW+eHMNSWNfFYQCzIGjH0vPV\nFOzX4vIkcOMgrtmEIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQP6WQH4b7K9py3XI9Gd32DwsYJQjU4K8rmJ4ybtFT/H7Gx51UV50tp/iZMsmBZFyAB\nl56OacMUstD2uKe7SWbQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T08:49:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://g