"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/5462a494dd9c27e74bbb53c6ffa0f32c6b04b5c9"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commit/c9627efbd719d53156d645cdac9725f581b7386f","sha":"c9627efbd719d53156d645cdac9725f581b7386f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/c9627efbd719d53156d645cdac9725f581b7386f"}],"sha":"fe692598f90bb76024bcbb252cd9b39fa0e4b7f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/fe692598f90bb76024bcbb252cd9b39fa0e4b7f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm","id":77401788,"login":"Okan-wqm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDAxNzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/9f888c95420486de6ee248ef00e3ff1a961c43d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:19:42Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:19:42Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"message":"test(admin): the tenant-write invariant sees every runtime schema shape\n\nThe multi-tenant review of the admin seeding removal found the guard\nnarrower than its claim. It missed member, call and prefixed\ninterpolation (`${record.schemaName}`, `tenant_${hex}`), unquoted schemas,\nstatements split across lines, TRUNCATE, and unqualified writes after a\nsearch_path set from a runtime value.\n\nIt now matches whole files with any interpolation, counts TRUNCATE, and\nrefuses a dynamic search_path outside the explorer''s READ ONLY EXPLAIN.\nRun against the pre-fix provisioning code it still reports the insert\nand the compensating delete.\n\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-07-measured-quantity-registry.md#FARM-MEDIUM-363","tree":{"sha":"124105ff5d34f40038c2c0ba161407cd659ce236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/trees/124105ff5d34f40038c2c0ba161407cd659ce236"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/commits/9f888c95420486de6ee248ef00e3ff1a961c43d8","verification":{"payload":"tree 124105ff5d34f40038c2c0ba161407cd659ce236\nparent 5b06b2292edba988181026a41a568b64e11ee2ee\nauthor OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791443982 +0200\ncommitter OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791443982 +0200\n\ntest(admin): the tenant-write invariant sees every runtime schema shape\n\nThe multi-tenant review of the admin seeding removal found the guard\nnarrower than its claim. It missed member, call and prefixed\ninterpolation (`${record.schemaName}`, `tenant_${hex}`), unquoted schemas,\nstatements split across lines, TRUNCATE, and unqualified writes after a\nsearch_path set from a runtime value.\n\nIt now matches whole files with any interpolation, counts TRUNCATE, and\nrefuses a dynamic search_path outside the explorer''s READ ONLY EXPLAIN.\nRun against the pre-fix provisioning code it still reports the insert\nand the compensating delete.\n\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-07-measured-quantity-registry.md#FARM-MEDIUM-363\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS9nW+eHMNSWNfFYQCzIGjH0vPV\nFOzX4vIkcOMgrtmEIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGdN8gQVF9e6rc4c5AI4GnRP5Ihu3pXit0lEyYw+hPCaX5DGjmCJ866TALdFGl5cDv\nKa03MDra0/9mJ+BWM+5gw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T07:23:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm","id":77401788,"login":"Okan-wqm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDAxNzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commit/9f888c95420486de6ee248ef00e3ff1a961c43d8","node_id":"C_kwDOQ4Ocb9oAKDlmODg4Yzk1NDIwNDg2ZGU2ZWUyNDhlZjAwZTNmZjFhOTYxYzQzZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commit/5b06b2292edba988181026a41a568b64e11ee2ee","sha":"5b06b2292edba988181026a41a568b64e11ee2ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/5b06b2292edba988181026a41a568b64e11ee2ee"}],"sha":"9f888c95420486de6ee248ef00e3ff1a961c43d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/9f888c95420486de6ee248ef00e3ff1a961c43d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm","id":77401788,"login":"Okan-wqm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDAxNzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/5b06b2292edba988181026a41a568b64e11ee2ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:18:30Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:18:30Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"message":"fix(sensor): a system pick offers its tanks, and the wizard''s placement is proven\n\nThe sensor review of the placement change found that the registration\nwizard filtered units on system links its equipment query never selected.\nPicking a system, the main RAS flow, emptied the unit list, so a tank\ncould not be recorded at all. The picked system now goes to farm''s list\nfilter, which already narrows tanks and system-linked equipment alike.\n\nThe parent''s wire input is built in one function (toRegisterParentInput).\nA step test proves a tank pick is sent as tankId and a biofilter as\nequipmentId, and fails if any of the three wizard lines is reverted.\n\nNo backfill: prod (the only deployment) holds no sensor with a tank id in\nequipment_id, verified 2026-10-08, so the description''s equipmentId means\nnon-tank equipment for every row.\n\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-07-sensor-placement-identity.md#SENSOR-MEDIUM-172","tree":{"sha":"c209c885d4189d80ea380b7ba73d95a0c148036c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/trees/c209c885d4189d80ea380b7ba73d95a0c148036c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/commits/5b06b2292edba988181026a41a568b64e11ee2ee","verification":{"payload":"tree c209c885d4189d80ea380b7ba73d95a0c148036c\nparent fc7d87ce2999da6882d605d30f137f6146f7c0ab\nauthor OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791443910 +0200\ncommitter OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791443910 +0200\n\nfix(sensor): a system pick offers its tanks, and the wizard''s placement is proven\n\nThe sensor review of the placement change found that the registration\nwizard filtered units on system links its equipment query never selected.\nPicking a system, the main RAS flow, emptied the unit list, so a tank\ncould not be recorded at all. The picked system now goes to farm''s list\nfilter, which already narrows tanks and system-linked equipment alike.\n\nThe parent''s wire input is built in one function (toRegisterParentInput).\nA step test proves a tank pick is sent as tankId and a biofilter as\nequipmentId, and fails if any of the three wizard lines is reverted.\n\nNo backfill: prod (the only deployment) holds no sensor with a tank id in\nequipment_id, verified 2026-10-08, so the description''s equipmentId means\nnon-tank equipment for every row.\n\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-07-sensor-placement-identity.md#SENSOR-MEDIUM-172\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS9nW+eHMNSWNfFYQCzIGjH0vPV\nFOzX4vIkcOMgrtmEIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAOFPHk6+If80fLkLfxNL3FnEOQ4pPycnMRL4hZo9OnSQPF8IsGxQGgbXeZOg5Dbkc\nb6OUvcZqZUxgWqMcZO1Qo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T07:23:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm","id":77401788,"login":"Okan-wqm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDAxNzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commit/5b06b2292edba988181026a41a568b64e11ee2ee","node_id":"C_kwDOQ4Ocb9oAKDViMDZiMjI5MmVkYmE5ODgxODEwMjZhNDFhNTY4YjY0ZTExZWUyZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commit/fc7d87ce2999da6882d605d30f137f6146f7c0ab","sha":"fc7d87ce2999da6882d605d30f137f6146f7c0ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/fc7d87ce2999da6882d605d30f137f6146f7c0ab"}],"sha":"5b06b2292edba988181026a41a568b64e11ee2ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/5b06b2292edba988181026a41a568b64e11ee2ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/us