2999da6882d605d30f137f6146f7c0ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/fc7d87ce2999da6882d605d30f137f6146f7c0ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm","id":77401788,"login":"Okan-wqm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDAxNzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/c3662ef66ce91c4213628608d0ed0d74683b3548/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:19:24Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:19:24Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"message":"fix(aria): the cycle dispatches the drain that follows it\n\nThe drain followed the cycle only through a workflow_run trigger on the\nexecutor. GitHub creates no workflow_run event for a run started with\nthe job token, and both the executor''s own chain-next-cycle (the\nrhythm''s return edge) and the dataflow watchdog start the cycle that\nway. So every chained cycle ended with no drain after it, and the loop\nran one cycle and stopped. Cycle 37728223278 (workflow_dispatch by\ngithub-actions[bot]) finished at 05:55Z with F-015''s plan started and\nF-013''s implementer requeued, and no executor followed until one was\ndispatched by hand.\n\nThe forward edge is now an explicit dispatch, the one event the job\ntoken may create. A hosted chain-executor job in aria-auto-cycle (needs\ncycle, runs unless cancelled, actions: write only) dispatches\naria-agent-executor. The workflow_run trigger is removed so the edge has\none mechanism. The shared concurrency group still makes the executor\nwait for the cycle run to finish. A cycle an operator cancels chains\nnothing. The executor''s inputs keep their defaults, so the drain is\nreal, as before.\n\ntest_workflow_chain_edges.py fails when a workflow listens for\nworkflow_run on a workflow that any workflow starts with the job token,\nand pins both edges of the loop. Against main it names both\njob-token starters and finds no forward edge.\n\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-08-aria-cycle-drain-chain.md#ARIA-HIGH-386","tree":{"sha":"0707627542613d3b4be7b1bdb202b325d59c1606","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/trees/0707627542613d3b4be7b1bdb202b325d59c1606"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/commits/c3662ef66ce91c4213628608d0ed0d74683b3548","verification":{"payload":"tree 0707627542613d3b4be7b1bdb202b325d59c1606\nparent c9627efbd719d53156d645cdac9725f581b7386f\nauthor OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791440364 +0200\ncommitter OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791440364 +0200\n\nfix(aria): the cycle dispatches the drain that follows it\n\nThe drain followed the cycle only through a workflow_run trigger on the\nexecutor. GitHub creates no workflow_run event for a run started with\nthe job token, and both the executor''s own chain-next-cycle (the\nrhythm''s return edge) and the dataflow watchdog start the cycle that\nway. So every chained cycle ended with no drain after it, and the loop\nran one cycle and stopped. Cycle 37728223278 (workflow_dispatch by\ngithub-actions[bot]) finished at 05:55Z with F-015''s plan started and\nF-013''s implementer requeued, and no executor followed until one was\ndispatched by hand.\n\nThe forward edge is now an explicit dispatch, the one event the job\ntoken may create. A hosted chain-executor job in aria-auto-cycle (needs\ncycle, runs unless cancelled, actions: write only) dispatches\naria-agent-executor. The workflow_run trigger is removed so the edge has\none mechanism. The shared concurrency group still makes the executor\nwait for the cycle run to finish. A cycle an operator cancels chains\nnothing. The executor''s inputs keep their defaults, so the drain is\nreal, as before.\n\ntest_workflow_chain_edges.py fails when a workflow listens for\nworkflow_run on a workflow that any workflow starts with the job token,\nand pins both edges of the loop. Against main it names both\njob-token starters and finds no forward edge.\n\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-08-aria-cycle-drain-chain.md#ARIA-HIGH-386\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS9nW+eHMNSWNfFYQCzIGjH0vPV\nFOzX4vIkcOMgrtmEIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQM1uOEL2Q2AsMXBquBRgvgW82SYwJcGr/4W2fKb8Tr84g8adVZ90O4IBX4R0n1voiN\nEYBWfpTTgF9F0jDN3DRQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T06:24:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm","id":77401788,"login":"Okan-wqm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDAxNzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/orgs","