","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/ccef8b6952eaba705c4feba24561eb6ff03660d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:04:34Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:04:34Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"message":"fix(aria): mint only pressure evidence the agent law admits\n\nEvery aria-autonomy-planner request minted from a pipeline_stalled\npressure was rejected (4 of 4 since 2026-10-05). The pressure named a\ntools-root state ledger, knowledge-graph/pressure-source-effectiveness.jsonl:<source>,\nas its evidence. The autonomy projection copied it verbatim into the\nenvelope''s evidence_refs. The planner cited it, and the submit law grades\nrefs against the repository at target_sha, so no answer could pass. The\nmost urgent pressure was unanswerable by construction. Six more sources\nwrote the same class (pr-<n>:<sha>, aria-tools/memory/*.jsonl, an absolute\nstore path), and mission rows carry pr:<n> / branch:<name>. The\nARIA-HIGH-354 mint guard judged only refs that parse and resolve into the\nstore, so none of these were caught.\n\nThe fix reuses the split ORPHAN-HIGH-519 already draws for plans\n(evidence vs provenance_refs, judged by admissible_agent_evidence_refs):\n\n- evidence_validator.agent_ref_shape_refusal is the checkout-free half\n  of the agent law, using the submit law''s own codes.\n- pressure._pressure refuses non-citable evidence by name and takes a\n  provenance_refs channel. Kernel-authored origins (ledgers, PRs, store\n  files) move there; data-derived refs are split by\n  pressure_evidence.split_citable_refs.\n- funnel_health.FUNNEL_STAGES declares each stage''s owner code, so a stall\n  cites its stage''s code as evidence. discovery_incomplete cites\n  discovery.py.\n- The autonomy projection, for pressure and mission items, hands the\n  planner only refs the full law admits at the envelope''s target_sha.\n  Reason, provenance and refused refs travel as prompt data. A\n  host-unverifiable item stays pending instead of being spent.\n\ntest_pressure_evidence_citable fires every registered pressure source.\nAgainst main''s producers and projection it fails 21 checks.\n\nPR-sourced pressures, contradiction and uncertainty_repeat have no\nrepository anchor. Their queue items are now consumed and disclosed with\ntheir provenance, instead of minting requests no answer could satisfy.\n\nNot done here: create_agent_invocation_request does not yet refuse the\nclass for every role. review_runner/specialist_review_runner (cycle:<id>),\ndecision_questioning (plan:<id>) and the ARIA-HIGH-194 rule (self-output\nbeside a repo ref) mint non-repo refs on purpose, and their suites pin\nit. Tracked as ARIA-MEDIUM-385 (owner claude, deadline 2026-10-22).\n\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-08-aria-pressure-state-evidence.md#ARIA-HIGH-384","tree":{"sha":"860bd3874a34c7acc1e24266310fbb6073dc4245","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/trees/860bd3874a34c7acc1e24266310fbb6073dc4245"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/commits/ccef8b6952eaba705c4feba24561eb6ff03660d9","verification":{"payload":"tree 860bd3874a34c7acc1e24266310fbb6073dc4245\nparent 475d6dec716804ceb6813693e710658d708f7390\nauthor OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791439474 +0200\ncommitter OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791439474 +0200\n\nfix(aria): mint only pressure evidence the agent law admits\n\nEvery aria-autonomy-planner request minted from a pipeline_stalled\npressure was rejected (4 of 4 since 2026-10-05). The pressure named a\ntools-root state ledger, knowledge-graph/pressure-source-effectiveness.jsonl:<source>,\nas its evidence. The autonomy projection copied it verbatim into the\nenvelope''s evidence_refs. The planner cited it, and the submit law grades\nrefs against the repository at target_sha, so no answer could pass. The\nmost urgent pressure was unanswerable by construction. Six more sources\nwrote the same class (pr-<n>:<sha>, aria-tools/memory/*.jsonl, an absolute\nstore path), and mission rows carry pr:<n> / branch:<name>. The\nARIA-HIGH-354 mint guard judged only refs that parse and resolve into the\nstore, so none of these were caught.\n\nThe fix reuses the split ORPHAN-HIGH-519 already draws for plans\n(evidence vs provenance_refs, judged by admissible_agent_evidence_refs):\n\n- evidence_validator.agent_ref_shape_refusal is the checkout-free half\n  of the agent law, using the submit law''s own codes.\n- pressure._pressure refuses non-citable evidence by name and takes a\n  provenance_refs channel. Kernel-authored origins (ledgers, PRs, store\n  files) move there; data-derived refs are split by\n  pressure_evidence.split_citable_refs.\n- funnel_health.FUNNEL_STAGES declares each stage''s owner code, so a stall\n  cites its stage''s code as evidence. discovery_incomplete cites\n  discovery.py.\n- The autonomy projection, for pressure and mission items, hands the\n  planner only refs the full law admits at the envelope''s target_sha.\n  Reason, provenance and refused refs travel as prompt data. A\n  host-unverifiable item stays pending instead of being spent.\n\ntest_pressure_evidence_citable fires every registered pressure source.\nAgainst main''s producers and projection it fails 21 checks.\n\nPR-sourced pressures, contradiction and uncertainty_repeat have no\nrepository anchor. Their queue items are now consumed and disclosed with\ntheir provenance, instead of minting requests no answer could satisfy.\n\nNot done here: create_agent_invocation_request does not yet refuse the\nclass for every role. review_runner/specialist_review_runner (cycle:<id>),\ndecision_questioning (plan:<id>) and the ARIA-HIGH-194 rule (self-output\nbeside a repo ref) mint non-repo refs on purpose, and their suites pin\nit. Tracked as ARIA-MEDIUM-385 (owner claude, deadline 2026-10-22).\n\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-08-aria-pressure-state-evidence.md#ARIA-HIGH-384\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS9nW+eHMNSWNfFYQCzIGjH0vPV\nFOzX4vIkcOMgrtmEIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQA+Ro7302LOJj7HoXihV7EsiurTndVF6628O+kKJHNNi5qBezwNdlGV4kb+eyp+zlJ\nW6DBRReHKZcXVJ8dtyngw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T06:06:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm","id":77401788,"login":"Okan-wqm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDAxNzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commit/ccef8b6952eaba705c4feba24561eb6ff03660d9","nod