wqm/aquaculture_platform/commit/6f7d9aac201e438469acf4da5401217672989a91","sha":"6f7d9aac201e438469acf4da5401217672989a91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/6f7d9aac201e438469acf4da5401217672989a91"}],"sha":"c6cfdcb63871b0c2d025a85df498e12f731b1441","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/c6cfdcb63871b0c2d025a85df498e12f731b1441"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Okan-wqm","id":77401788,"login":"Okan-wqm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDAxNzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/commits/6f7d9aac201e438469acf4da5401217672989a91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:20:35Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:20:35Z","email":"77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"OKAN OZTURK"},"message":"fix(aria-kernel): keep refused re-mints off the anchor-stale sweep''s slots\n\nRe-review of #1833 (HIGH-A, MEDIUM-B, MEDIUM-C, minor):\n\n- The anchor-stale sweep sliced its 50 slots before deciding, and a\n  re-mint the request-admission door refused wrote no record, so the same\n  newest pre-door judges were re-planned every cycle while the backlog\n  stayed over budget and the ~560 open records and expiries behind them\n  (operator hand-offs, re-offers, drops) were never decided. The bound now\n  counts decided items; the sweep asks the door once per (producer, role)\n  before a re-mint and a refused class waits like a full judge backlog.\n- A refused seed was booked as a minted plan, then rejected. The\n  orchestrator asks the drainer''s own seed_admission before booking: a\n  refusal writes one governance row (convergence_seed_throttled), starts\n  no convergence and touches no funnel counter.\n- A panel opened as discretionary, so the critical re-mint behind it was\n  unreachable under backlog pressure. A panel now opens under the class\n  recorded on the request whose death it adjudicates\n  (human_required_panel.open_critical); in-flight plans never depended on\n  it, the drainer re-mints a dead step itself.\n- A critical admission reads no ledger; uncycled keys are not cached and\n  the per-cycle cache keeps the 16 newest.\n\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-07-aria-request-admission-budget.md#ARIA-HIGH-364","tree":{"sha":"1f259ecab7b064dbe8d76d7c31e99a61aee9fa2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/trees/1f259ecab7b064dbe8d76d7c31e99a61aee9fa2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Okan-wqm/aquaculture_platform/git/commits/6f7d9aac201e438469acf4da5401217672989a91","verification":{"payload":"tree 1f259ecab7b064dbe8d76d7c31e99a61aee9fa2a\nparent eaf5bb6cb6cce087eced2314d81673579d937bf7\nauthor OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791404435 +0200\ncommitter OKAN OZTURK <77401788+Okan-wqm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791404435 +0200\n\nfix(aria-kernel): keep refused re-mints off the anchor-stale sweep''s slots\n\nRe-review of #1833 (HIGH-A, MEDIUM-B, MEDIUM-C, minor):\n\n- The anchor-stale sweep sliced its 50 slots before deciding, and a\n  re-mint the request-admission door refused wrote no record, so the same\n  newest pre-door judges were re-planned every cycle while the backlog\n  stayed over budget and the ~560 open records and expiries behind them\n  (operator hand-offs, re-offers, drops) were never decided. The bound now\n  counts decided items; the sweep asks the door once per (producer, role)\n  before a re-mint and a refused class waits like a full judge backlog.\n- A refused seed was booked as a minted plan, then rejected. The\n  orchestrator asks the drainer''s own seed_admission before booking: a\n  refusal writes one governance row (convergence_seed_throttled), starts\n  no convergence and touches no funnel counter.\n- A panel opened as discretionary, so the critical re-mint behind it was\n  unreachable under backlog pressure. A panel now opens under the class\n  recorded on the request whose death it adjudicates\n  (human_required_panel.open_critical); in-flight plans never depended on\n  it, the drainer re-mints a dead step itself.\n- A critical admission reads no ledger; uncycled keys are not cached and\n  the per-cycle cache keeps the 16 newest.\n\nCloses: docs/reviews/claude/2026-10-07-aria-request-admission-budget.md#ARIA-HIGH-364\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS9nW+eHMNSWNfFYQCzIGjH0vPV\nFOzX4vIkcOMgrtmEIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOgIjE0UhPx3V56DhBqOIaRz8AgX8g6SOEoS4B/Ca7S6LwrpzYRglQLrpMfHK1GBKj\nNKp1d2xI+szyVQ8orc9gk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T20:22:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77401788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Okan-wqm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":""